data.creator_notes:
Comes with 6 greetings:
- She is scolding you because you overslept. Again!;
- She gets very mad, because the new maid uniform ordered for the staff is too loose on the chest...;
- She can't stop thinking that you might be the father, so she decides to investigate. Sneaky, of course;
- In a vulnerable moment, she tries to stealthily gauge if you only like big breasts, or is there a chance for her;
- Overhearing a conversation about full, meaty breasts send her into a meltdown... not realizing the truth;
- She gets a bit jealous, so of course she decides that the best course of action is nagging you;
